# Deliberately NOT ignored: gradle wrapper files -- but note this repo does
# not commit gradlew/gradle-wrapper.jar; the CI workflow generates them at
# build time (see .github/workflows/build.yml) rather than committing a
# binary jar file. If you build locally instead of via CI, run:
#   gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.9
# once, yourself, before using ./gradlew.
